# Whispers of Dawn (WotG 47), the whole run, in Grauberg [S]. With nothing equipped the Veridical Conflux plays 26 [89,
# 23, 1756, 0, 0, 8323073] (no weapons); its finish with option 0 does nothing. With a Bronze Sword in the main slot it
# plays 26 [89, 23, 1756, 0, 0, 8323073, 0, 1]; its finish with option 1 writes A Dreamy Interlude's Timer 8001 and
# mustZone 89 and completes the mission (A Dreamy Interlude current).
lists GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrigger GraubergS/onEventFinish/26
char zone=GraubergS pos=-140.28,-6.749,585.24 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg WhispersOfDawn current
item BronzeSword
login
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # 26, no weapons
finish option=0                            # not 1: nothing
equip BronzeSword Main
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # 26, a main weapon
finish option=1                            # A Dreamy Interlude's Timer and mustZone; completed
